{"id":"21f5ed9f94a46a9b","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-sacks-density.md","title":"c.e. 度的 Sacks 稠密性（待补证明）","display":"thm-sacks-density — c.e. 度的 Sacks 稠密性（待补证明）","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-sacks-density","aliases":["20-thm-sacks-density"],"display":"thm-sacks-density — c.e. 度的 Sacks 稠密性（待补证明）","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.degree-structure","source_kind":"legacy-supplement","verification_status":"pending-source","source_reference":"既有书外结果；§16.1 仅作历史提示","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"depends_on":["[[20-df-redeg]]","[[20-df-degle]]","[[20-df-dense]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-sacks-density"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-sacks-density</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sacks-density — c.e. 度的 Sacks 稠密性（待补证明）"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.degree-structure"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"legacy-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"pending-source"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"既有书外结果；§16.1 仅作历史提示"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ee7d86f9583b7de8\" href=\"?note=ee7d86f9583b7de8\" title=\"20-df-dense\">20-df-dense</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf b\">\\(\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf b\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ee7d86f9583b7de8\" href=\"?note=ee7d86f9583b7de8\" title=\"20-df-dense\">20-df-dense</a>。</p>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"todo\"><div class=\"callout-title\">核验边界</div><p>本条状态为 pending-source；正文给出修订后的定义或命题草案，尚缺完整来源核对或独立证明。不可仅凭文件类型将其作为已认证定理使用。</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}density}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\ [\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf c&lt;\\mathbf b].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}density}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\ [\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf c&lt;\\mathbf b].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>不能由每个非零 c.e. 度有非零严格下度推得任意区间稠密。原书 §16.1 提到 Sacks 的复杂构造历史，却未在旧稿所指章节提供本定理证明；完整区间构造及原始论文待核对。</p>\n<p>来源：既有书外结果；§16.1 仅作历史提示。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"re